{"product_id":"evo-earbuds","title":"Evo Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEVO Earbuds\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds bring a bold new edge to sound and style. With a sleek metallic finish, powerful 10 mm drivers, and dual-mic ENC for crystal-clear calls, EVO is designed for those who live loud and make every beat their own. Built to match Gen Z energy, it’s where performance meets personality.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePremium Metallic Design – Glossy metallic casing with bold color options. \u003cbr\u003eLightweight 36.5 g build for everyday comfort and portability.\u003cbr\u003ePowerful Sound Performance – 10 mm dynamic drivers deliver balanced bass and crisp treble.\u003cbr\u003eENC Voice Clarity – Dual-mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) ensures clear calls even in noisy environments.\u003cbr\u003eBattery Performance –\u003cbr\u003eEarbuds: 40 mAh each (approx. 5–6 hours playtime)\u003cbr\u003eUp to 50 Hours total play time.\u003cbr\u003eCharging Type – Type C\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Connectivity – Bluetooth 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eSmart Touch Controls –\u003cbr\u003ePlay\/Pause: Single-tap MFB button\u003cbr\u003eNext Track: Double-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003ePrevious Track: Double-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume +: Triple-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume –: Triple-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003eVoice Assistant (Siri \/ Google): Press and hold 2 s\u003cbr\u003eAnswer \/ Hang up Call: Single-tap MFB\u003cbr\u003eReject Call: Long-press 2 s MFB\u003cbr\u003eTurn Off: Press and hold 4 s\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance – IPX4 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Case Dimensions: 60.1 × 48.36 × 26.6 mm\u003cbr\u003eWeight: 36.5 g (total)\u003cbr\u003eBattery Capacity: Earbuds 40 mAh each \/ Case 400 mAh\u003cbr\u003eTotal Playtime: 50 hours\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Range: 10 m\u003cbr\u003eDriver Size: 10 mm dynamic drivers\u003cbr\u003eMicrophones: Dual mic + ENC \u003cbr\u003eControls: Smart Touch (MFB multi-function buttons)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose EVO Earbuds?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds are engineered for those who thrive on individuality. With their metallic build, punchy 10 mm drivers, and ENC-enhanced voice clarity, EVO ensures your music and calls always sound as good as you look. Designed for expressive, everyday use. It’s not just another pair of earbuds, it’s your sound, your style, your EVO.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50630768132374,"sku":"23463","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50630768197910,"sku":"23470","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50630768165142,"sku":"23464","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ruby Red","offer_id":50630768230678,"sku":"23468","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50630768099606,"sku":"23466","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/evo_jet-back_3.webp?v=1776686260","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/evo-earbuds","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}